      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How each (fictional) waste operator performs**, measured from the customer's own records. Higher is better for *on time* and *tickets shared*; lower is better for the rest.\nUse it as **facts for contract talks**, not blame: weight bias and billing differences can also come from device sensors, combined truck loads or missing data."
      }
